1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,458
Seorang ayah menasihati

2
00:00:01,478 --> 00:00:02,122
anaknya.

3
00:00:02,142 --> 00:00:03,329
Nasihatnya begitu berharga

4
00:00:03,349 --> 00:00:04,924
sampai diabadikan dalam

5
00:00:04,944 --> 00:00:05,883
Al-Qur'an, dan surahnya

6
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:07,263
dinamai dengan namanya.

7
00:00:07,283 --> 00:00:08,377
Ia bukan raja,

8
00:00:08,397 --> 00:00:09,491
bukan panglima,

9
00:00:09,511 --> 00:00:10,843
hanya seorang ayah yang bijak.

10
00:00:10,863 --> 00:00:12,306
Surah Luqman ayat dua belas:

11
00:00:12,326 --> 00:00:14,307
Allah memberi Luqman hikmah.

12
00:00:14,327 --> 00:00:15,173
Dan hikmah pertamanya

13
00:00:15,193 --> 00:00:16,090
sederhana:

14
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:17,507
bersyukurlah kepada Allah.

15
00:00:17,527 --> 00:00:18,730
Nasihat pertamanya kepada

16
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,721
anaknya adalah fondasi

17
00:00:19,741 --> 00:00:20,515
segalanya.

18
00:00:20,535 --> 00:00:21,088
Wahai anakku,

19
00:00:21,108 --> 00:00:22,671
jangan mempersekutukan Allah.

20
00:00:22,691 --> 00:00:23,786
Sesungguhnya mempersekutukan

21
00:00:23,806 --> 00:00:25,195
Allah adalah kezaliman yang

22
00:00:25,215 --> 00:00:26,160
besar.

23
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:27,414
Di tengah nasihat itu,

24
00:00:27,434 --> 00:00:28,683
Allah menyelipkan pesan

25
00:00:28,703 --> 00:00:29,932
tentang orang tua:

26
00:00:29,952 --> 00:00:31,496
ibu mengandung dalam keadaan

27
00:00:31,516 --> 00:00:32,749
lemah yang bertambah-tambah,

28
00:00:32,769 --> 00:00:34,439
lalu menyapih dalam dua tahun.

29
00:00:34,459 --> 00:00:36,064
Bersyukurlah kepada-Ku dan

30
00:00:36,084 --> 00:00:37,691
kepada kedua orang tuamu.

31
00:00:37,711 --> 00:00:39,673
Lalu Luqman mengajarkan bahwa

32
00:00:39,693 --> 00:00:41,298
tidak ada yang luput.

33
00:00:41,318 --> 00:00:42,041
Wahai anakku,

34
00:00:42,061 --> 00:00:43,543
perbuatan seberat biji sawi

35
00:00:43,563 --> 00:00:44,828
pun, walau tersembunyi di

36
00:00:44,848 --> 00:00:45,818
dalam batu,

37
00:00:45,838 --> 00:00:46,809
di langit,

38
00:00:46,829 --> 00:00:47,645
atau di bumi,

39
00:00:47,665 --> 00:00:49,092
Allah akan mendatangkannya.

40
00:00:49,112 --> 00:00:50,129
Dirikan salat,

41
00:00:50,149 --> 00:00:51,642
ajak kepada kebaikan,

42
00:00:51,662 --> 00:00:52,994
cegah kemungkaran,

43
00:00:53,014 --> 00:00:55,084
dan bersabarlah atas apa yang

44
00:00:55,104 --> 00:00:55,891
menimpamu.

45
00:00:55,911 --> 00:00:57,470
Semua itu termasuk perkara

46
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,160
yang penting.

47
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,600
Jangan memalingkan wajah dari

48
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:00,838
manusia karena sombong,

49
00:01:00,858 --> 00:01:01,968
jangan berjalan di bumi dengan

50
00:01:01,988 --> 00:01:02,634
angkuh.

51
00:01:02,654 --> 00:01:04,011
Sederhanakan langkahmu,

52
00:01:04,031 --> 00:01:05,002
dan lunakkan suaramu.

53
00:01:05,022 --> 00:01:05,962
Seburuk-buruk suara,

54
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:08,049
katanya, adalah suara keledai.

55
00:01:08,069 --> 00:01:10,093
Dari tauhid sampai cara

56
00:01:10,113 --> 00:01:11,439
berjalan dan berbicara.

57
00:01:11,459 --> 00:01:12,523
Nasihat mana yang paling ingin

58
00:01:12,543 --> 00:01:13,297
kamu wariskan?

59
00:01:13,317 --> 00:01:15,093
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

60
00:01:15,113 --> 00:01:16,302
bersama AUDIRA.

